WEBVTT

00:01:59.139 --> 00:02:03.607
and we have to welcome new perspectives
every step of the way.

00:02:03.631 --> 00:02:06.108
Not because it's the right thing to do --

00:02:06.132 --> 00:02:07.647
although it is --

00:02:07.671 --> 00:02:12.005
but because that's the only way
for us to all succeed together.

00:02:12.355 --> 00:02:14.355
And here's the best news of all.

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:16.514
I know how to do it.

00:02:16.538 --> 00:02:19.164
The answer -- well, an answer,

00:02:19.188 --> 00:02:21.482
is participatory budgeting.

00:02:21.839 --> 00:02:23.085
That's right.

00:02:23.109 --> 00:02:27.346
Participatory budgeting,
or "PB" for short.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:31.163
PB is a process that brings
community and government together